1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,529
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:02,531
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,149
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,424
Hello!

5
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:09,203
Let's dive under the sea!

6
00:00:09,203 --> 00:00:09,000
Splash!

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,800
Look! It's a fish.

8
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,725
Fish!

9
00:00:16,275 --> 00:00:19,175
The fish swims with its little fins.

10
00:00:20,875 --> 00:00:22,750
Who is this?

11
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:26,750
It's a dolphin!

12
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,575
What does the dolphin say?

13
00:00:30,975 --> 00:00:33,250
Click, click, squeak!

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,775
The dolphin loves to jump and play.

15
00:00:38,475 --> 00:00:40,650
Look! It's a turtle.

16
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,575
Turtle!

17
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:45,600
The turtle has a hard shell.

18
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,425
Look! It's a whale.

19
00:00:49,925 --> 00:00:51,424
Whale!

20
00:00:51,974 --> 00:00:54,749
The whale is very, very big.

21
00:00:56,449 --> 00:00:58,324
Who is this?

22
00:01:00,124 --> 00:01:02,073
It's a crab!

23
00:01:02,623 --> 00:01:04,711
The crab walks sideways.

24
00:01:04,711 --> 00:01:05,948
Pinch, pinch!

25
00:01:07,648 --> 00:01:10,023
Look! It's an octopus.

26
00:01:10,523 --> 00:01:12,273
Octopus!

27
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:15,448
The octopus has eight arms!

28
00:01:17,148 --> 00:01:19,997
Now let's play a memory game!

29
00:01:20,547 --> 00:01:22,135
Do you remember?

30
00:01:22,135 --> 00:01:23,222
Let's see!

31
00:01:24,922 --> 00:01:26,822
What is this?

32
00:01:29,022 --> 00:01:30,448
Fish!

33
00:01:30,998 --> 00:01:33,298
Yes! Well done!

34
00:01:34,998 --> 00:01:36,898
What is this?

35
00:01:39,098 --> 00:01:40,798
Dolphin!

36
00:01:41,348 --> 00:01:43,298
That's right!

37
00:01:44,998 --> 00:01:46,898
What is this?

38
00:01:49,098 --> 00:01:50,524
Turtle!

39
00:01:51,074 --> 00:01:53,099
Great job!

40
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,699
What is this?

41
00:01:58,899 --> 00:02:00,398
Whale!

42
00:02:00,948 --> 00:02:02,923
You got it!

43
00:02:04,623 --> 00:02:06,523
What is this?

44
00:02:08,723 --> 00:02:10,247
Crab!

45
00:02:10,797 --> 00:02:12,497
Super!

46
00:02:14,197 --> 00:02:16,097
What is this?

47
00:02:18,297 --> 00:02:20,047
Octopus!

48
00:02:20,597 --> 00:02:22,247
Hooray!

49
00:02:23,947 --> 00:02:26,972
Wow! You remembered everything!

50
00:02:28,822 --> 00:02:31,472
You are a super learner!

51
00:02:33,172 --> 00:02:36,048
Bye bye, ocean friends!

52
00:02:36,598 --> 00:02:39,398
Great job, little learner!

53
00:02:39,948 --> 00:02:41,899
Share Mimzi with a friend,

54
00:02:41,899 --> 00:02:44,523
and subscribe for more learning fun!

55
00:02:45,073 --> 00:02:46,135
Next time,

56
00:02:46,135 --> 00:02:48,423
let's learn yummy fruits.

57
00:02:48,673 --> 00:02:50,398
Bye bye!
